                                                "sense_id": "12e25ab5-c3ab-3eea-b83c-f300b4dace79",
                                                "text": "But in the second generation of hybrids (from seed of the first) talls and dwarfs were both present, and in the proportion of twelve talls to four dwarfs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58c8ea1b-3590-41c9-acc8-8789bf6488dd",
                                                "sense_id": "12e25ab5-c3ab-3eea-b83c-f300b4dace79",
                                                "text": "The industries that best accommodate talls are those that have faced personal injury lawsuits."
                                            },
